  "result": "Perfect! I've added voucher support for fixed-amount discounts:\n\n**src/errors.js** \u2014 Added:\n- VOUCHER_EXISTS: Invoice already has a voucher\n\n**src/invoices.js** \u2014 Added:\n- **applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })** \u2014 Applies a fixed-amount voucher:\n  - amount must be positive integer (in cents)\n  - Draft invoices only (NOT_DRAFT if not draft)\n  - One voucher per invoice (VOUCHER_EXISTS if already has one)\n  - Returns ok(newInvoice) with voucher = { code, amount }\n  - Never mutates input invoice\n\n**Updated invoiceTotals:**\n- Now returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, voucher, total }`\n- Voucher is clamped at 0\n- total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher, clamped at 0\n\n**Key design:**\n- Vouchers apply after VAT (after all line calculations)\n- Fixed amount in cents, not a percentage\n- One per invoice, can only add to drafts\n- Deducted from final total\n\nAdded 10 tests covering voucher application, validation errors, mutation safety, and total calculations with all components (discount + VAT + voucher). All 156 tests pass.",
